Picture to Structure reads pictures with MolScribe, exported to ONNX. The model files are
downloaded on first use from the molion-plugins repository's releases; MolScribe's code and weights are
under the licence below (github.com/thomas0809/MolScribe, huggingface.co/yujieq/MolScribe).

The frozen plugin also contains onnxruntime (MIT, (c) Microsoft Corporation; its own
ThirdPartyNotices.txt is inside bin/), NumPy (BSD 3-Clause) and Pillow (MIT-CMU).

